                                "example_id": "b5eaeda0-f7b0-4750-b929-d88619ab15af",
                                "sense_id": "c1535f58-0d40-3b1f-93da-dd25e7d35025",
                                "text": "Э́то не идёт ни в како́е сравне́ние с че́м-либо/ке́м-либо.",
                                "translation": "It cannot be compared with something/someone.",
                                "english": "It cannot be compared with something/someone."
                            },
                            {
